    "Children cannot calm down alone.",\par
    "Your calm presence helps regulate their nervous system.",\par
    "Teaching works only after the child is calm."\par
  ],\par
  "reflection": [\par
    "How do I feel during my child\rquote s meltdowns?",\par
    "What helps me stay calm?"\par
  ],\par
  "actions": [\par
    "Take a slow breath before responding.",\par
    "Sit beside your child instead of talking at them.",\par
    "Use simple phrases like 'I\rquote m here. You\rquote re safe.'"\par
  ]\par
\}\par
